SF0043 Temporary water use agreements amendments.
Sponsored By: Joint Agriculture, State and Public Lands & Water
Resources Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to water; extending the number of years for which temporary
water rights may be granted; providing exceptions; and providing for an
effective date.
